## Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Resource Delivery Mission  

| **Name** | **Text** | **Runtime** | **Goal Type** | **Target Condition / Enquired Info** | **Relation** |
|----------|----------|-------------|---------------|-------------------------------------|--------------|
| **G1 – Deliver Resources** | Deliver requested resources to the specified location. | **#** (parallel execution of the three sub‑goals) | **Achieve** | *All requested resources are at the destination.* | **AND** |
| **G1.1 – Collection Phase** | Collect the requested resources from the storage locations. | **;** (sequential sub‑goals) | **Perform** | – | **AND** |
| **G1.1.1 – Request Resources** | Send a request to the storage for the needed resources. | **;** | **Perform** | – | **AND** |
| **G1.1.2 – Retrieve Resources** | Wait for the storage to hand over the resources and physically retrieve them. | **;** | **Perform** | – | **AND** |
| **G1.1.3 – Battery Management (Collection)** | Monitor battery level during collection and recharge if needed. | **-** (leaf goal) | **Perform** | – | **-** |
| **G1.2 – Delivery Phase** | Transport the collected resources to the delivery location. | **;** | **Perform** | – | **AND** |
| **G1.2.1 – Transport Resources** | Move the resources from storage to the destination. | **;** | **Perform** | – | **AND** |
| **G1.2.2 – Battery Management (Delivery)** | Monitor battery level during delivery and return to a checkpoint if required. | **-** | **Perform** | – | **-** |
| **G1.3 – Failure Handling** | Detect, report, and react to failures during the mission. | **;** | **Perform** | – | **AND** |
| **G1.3.1 – Detect Failure** | Monitor for any failure condition (e.g., low battery, lost resource). | **-** | **Perform** | – | **-** |
| **G1.3.2 – Trigger Alert** | Raise an alert when a failure is detected. | **-** | **Perform** | – | **-** |
| **G1.3.3 – Report to Sector Manager** | Send a detailed failure report to the sector manager. | **-** | **Perform** | – | **-** |

