## Task Model – Concrete Robot Actions  

| **Name** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** |
|----------|----------|--------------|--------------|----------------------|
| **AT1 – Navigate to Storage** | Robot moves to the storage location to prepare a request. | **AND** (with AT2) | *Storage* | 1 |
| **AT2 – Send Request Message** | Robot sends a message to the storage specifying the required resources. | **AND** (with AT1) | *Storage* | 1 |
| **AT3 – Wait for Retrieval** | Robot waits until the storage has retrieved the resources. | **AND** (with AT4) | *Storage* | 1 |
| **AT4 – Retrieve Resources** | Robot physically collects the requested resources from the storage. | **AND** (with AT3) | *Storage* | 1 |
| **AT5 – Navigate to Destination** | Robot moves from the storage to the specified delivery location. | **AND** (with AT6) | *Destination* | 1 |
| **AT6 – Deliver Resources** | Robot delivers the resources to the requesting agent. | **AND** (with AT5) | *Destination* | 1 |
| **AT7 – Go to Recharging Station** | Robot goes to the recharging station to recharge its battery. | **-** | *Recharging Station* | 1 |
| **AT8 – Return Resources to Checkpoint** | Robot returns the resources to a checkpoint for hand‑over. | **-** | *Checkpoint* | 1 |
| **AT9 – Trigger Alert** | Robot triggers an alert in case of a failure. | **-** | *Robot* | 1 |
| **AT10 – Send Report** | Robot sends the failure report to the sector manager. | **-** | *Sector Manager* | 1 |

