## Logical Relationships (Tree Structure)

```
G1  -> G1.1, G1.2, G1.3  [AND][#]
G1.1 -> G1.1.1, G1.1.2, G1.1.3  [AND][;]
G1.1.1 -> AT1, AT2  [AND][;]
G1.1.2 -> AT3, AT4  [AND][;]
G1.1.3 -> AT7  [-]
G1.2 -> G1.2.1, G1.2.2  [AND][;]
G1.2.1 -> AT5, AT6  [AND][;]
G1.2.2 -> AT8  [-]
G1.3 -> G1.3.1, G1.3.2, G1.3.3  [AND][;]
G1.3.1 -> –  [-]
G1.3.2 -> AT9  [-]
G1.3.3 -> AT10  [-]
```

*The runtime symbols are: `#` – parallel, `;` – sequential, `-` – leaf goal/task.*
